{"id":8354,"name":"Cook County","slug":"cook-county","state":"Illinois","code":"IL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/illinois-the-best-tax-lien-state-with-36percent-return-on-investment/cook-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:23","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates","typicalSaleDate":"January (Annual Tax Sale)","redemptionPeriod":"Up to 3 years","interestRate":"Up to 54% over three years (9% every six months)","bidProcedure":"Bid-down process","deposit":"Required for registration","extra":[{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Cook County Auction Site"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Unlock-Big-Returns-with-Cook-County's-Tax-Lien-Auction\">Unlock Big Returns with Cook County&#8217;s Tax Lien Auction: Your Path to High Returns</h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"Zo2sI7JHiwObcAuryeBLaY964ph1jWRqMnmg0QTESfNUV5dzCXlKtkvPF3GDx\"><iframe title=\"Cook County, Illinois Tax Lien Auction: An opportunity for you to earn up to 54% returns.\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j3MqmBoWDi8?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Are you looking for a smart investment with great returns? Cook County, Illinois, offers a fantastic opportunity through its tax lien auction. By participating, you can earn up to 54% returns over three years. Let&#8217;s dive into how you can get started and make the most of this opportunity.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"What-Are-Tax-Lien-Certificates?\">What Are Tax Lien Certificates?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien investing means you pay someone’s overdue property taxes. In return, you get a certificate that earns you interest. If the property owner doesn’t pay you back, you might even end up owning the property!</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Interest Rate</strong>: Earn 9% interest every six months.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Potential Returns</strong>: 18% in a year, 54% over three years if the owner doesn&#8217;t pay you back.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Lien-Investing\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing</h4>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Understand the Local Laws</strong><br>It&#8217;s important to know the rules. Check Cook County&#8217;s guidelines on the <a href=\"https://www.cookcountytreasurer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Treasurer’s website</mark></a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong><br>Find all necessary info about tax sales on the <a href=\"https://www.cookcountytreasurer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cook County Treasurer’s site</mark></a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong><br>Register online and join the auction at<mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> the </mark><a href=\"https://www.cooktaxsale.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cook County Auction Site</mark></a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details</strong><br>Know the sale schedule and details about each property up for auction.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong><br>If you have questions, reach out to the Treasurer&#8217;s Office for help.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cook-County-Court-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-13847 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Cook County Court\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register Early</strong>: Sign up in December to secure your spot.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Research Properties</strong>: Know what you’re bidding on to avoid surprises.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Check the Treasurer’s site often for new information.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Links:\">Important Links:</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cookcountytreasurer.com/annualtaxsale.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Annual Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cookcountytreasurer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cook County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cookcountyil.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cook County Government</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cooktaxsale.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h4>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner doesn’t pay back?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: If the owner doesn’t redeem the lien within three years, you can start foreclosure to take ownership of the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I join the auction?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Register on the<a href=\"https://www.cooktaxsale.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Auction Site</mark></a> and make a deposit to participate.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What’s the interest rate for Cook County tax liens?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You can earn up to 9% interest every six months, totalling up to 54% over three years.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>By following these steps, you can tap into the potential high returns offered by Cook County&#8217;s tax lien auction. Happy investing!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?<a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/california-tax-sale-buy-real-estate-up-to-90-off/los-angeles-county/#Need-a-Hand?\"></a></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need some guidance with this process, you can&nbsp;<a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">book a call with us here</mark>.</a>&nbsp;We’re here to help you navigate the process, avoid common pitfalls, and potentially save you three to five years of trial and error.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Don’t miss out on the free resources available at the same link.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Get our free Tax Lien &amp; Deed Mini-Course, or book a call with us to build a free customized Tax Lien &amp; Deed investing plan. Save yourself years of trial and error.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Get it here</mark></a>.</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}